--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Notes:
-- - sys.dm_db_index_physical_stats(..., LIMITED) is fast but less thorough; use ('DETAILED') for deeper analysis.
-- - Heaps (index_id = 0) are excluded. To include heaps, modify the WHERE filter.
-- - Online rebuild requires appropriate SQL Server edition and may be unavailable for some index types.
-- - Consider maintenance windows and transaction log impact when rebuilding large indexes.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
